          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

PROV-O native provenance activity building block for CDIF. Extends the minimal prov:Activity (generatedBy) with W3C PROV-O properties for comprehensive provenance documentation. Uses schema.org fallbacks only where PROV-O has no equivalent (name, description, instrument, methodology, status).
:title: "PROV-O Provenance Activity"
:rdfType: ``prov:Activity``
:typeDescription: "Must include prov:Activity. Unlike cdifProvActivity, does not require schema:Action dual typing."
:typeOptional:
:noId:
:extends:</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.provProperties.provActivity.Activity"/>
        </ownedComment>
